c-app-scripts build --dev\n\n[14:33:55]  ionic-app-scripts 0.0.36 \n[14:33:55]  build dev started ... \n[14:33:55]  clean started ... \n[14:33:55]  clean finished in 3 ms \n[14:33:55]  copy started ... \n[14:33:55]  transpile started ... \n[14:33:55]  lint started ... \n[14:33:57]  lint finished in 1.45 s \n[14:33:59]  transpile finished in 3.51 s \n[14:33:59]  bundle started ... \n[14:33:59]  copy finished in 3.56 s \n[14:34:05]  bundle failed: 'ChartistModule' is not exported by node_modules/angular2-chartist/dist/angular2-chartist.js \n            (imported by src/app/app.module.ts). For help fixing this error see https://github.com/rollup/rollup/wiki/Troubleshooting#name-is-not-exported-by-module \n[14:34:05]  ionic-app-script task: \"build\" \n[14:34:05]  Error: 'ChartistModule' is not exported by node_modules/angular2-chartist/dist/angular2-chartist.js \n            (imported by src/app/app.module.ts). For help fixing this error see https://github.com/rollup/rollup/wiki/Troubleshooting#name-is-not-exported-by-module \n```\n\nNot sure but it might be related to the module bundler ionic is using in context with AoT compiler [Link](https://forum.ionicframework.com/t/unexpected-value-ng2completermodule-imported-by-the-module-appmodule/65922). However if I use the `--dev` argument the JiT compiler should be used and the issue is supposed to go away for the price of a larger and slower app - but it doesn't. Some people suggest that external modules need to be made compliant for AoT....that's why I am raising it here again. \n\nMy app.modules.ts:\n\n```\nimport { NgModule } from '@angular/core';\nimport { IonicApp, IonicModule } from 'ionic-angular';\nimport { MyApp } from './app.component';\nimport { Main } from '../pages/main/main';\nimport { Scan } from '../pages/scan/scan';\nimport { BleComms } from '../providers/blecomms';\nimport { ChartistModule } from 'angular2-chartist';\nimport { Chart } from '../pages/main/chart';\n\n@NgModule({\n  declarations: [\n    Main,\n    Scan,\n    Chart, \n  ],\n  imports: [\n    ChartistModule,\n    IonicModule.forRoot(MyApp),\n  ],\n  bootstrap: [IonicApp],\n  entryComponents: [\n    Main,\n    Scan,\n  ],\n  providers: [BleComms]\n})\nexport class AppModule {}\n```\n\nAny idea? \n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willsoto/ng-chartist/issues/55/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/willsoto/ng-chartist/issues/55/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/529890582","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/13473#issuecomment-529890582","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/13473","id":529890582,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyOTg5MDU4Mg==","user":{"login":"angular-automatic-lock-bot[bot]","id":54863671,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTQ4NjM2NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/40213?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/angular-automatic-lock-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lo